# How to Clear the YMC Project Gallery Cache

Learn how to refresh your project gallery data by clearing the term cache in the WordPress dashboard. This guide provides quick steps to ensure your latest updates and changes are properly reflected on your site.

1\. Navigate to the Wordpress admin dashboard

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-23/3391ab32-25d9-4833-9e47-56aeaf5b2124/action-3daf1c077aca4b8189e857ed3eceb17b_bbff14e5ea884c9f99ed9cf5bc465e10_text_export.jpeg)


2\. Click YMC Filter

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-23/3391ab32-25d9-4833-9e47-56aeaf5b2124/action-3daf1c077aca4b8189e857ed3eceb17b_2d29a0b5de034d94bea15aedfd4a2c70_text_export.jpeg)


3\. Click Project Gallery

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-23/b293cc33-1945-4f5f-9a75-8e86ca20a003/action-36005efc43cd442caa050e390554c7c6_9cee4bc40cd44a3a99448f8ff02a0d62_text_export.jpeg)


4\. Click Clear Terms Cache

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-23/45167241-dddc-470f-a132-8808f08a9aa6/action-07c6c49462e44b6dab7f5c584c81ba0d_6376a5cf856e40f29d3821234261b484_text_export.jpeg)


5\. Click Save Changes

![](https://colony-recorder.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/files/2026-10-23/8724532c-e958-4ea7-9671-d50cc8375111/action-207ff4df275e4be09001ae031b748bd5_49e6a639d2da4b8baabf1f9447b2220e_text_export.jpeg)


